    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1440">

                <pb facs="1104" n="988" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg988"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.115/127.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Special Agent Silliman to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Vera Cruz</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-02-26">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 26, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Canada has transmitted to me for proper representation Department’s February 25
                    to him. Inasmuch as the clause referring to time limit and penalties appears
                    inconsistent with instruction of previous clause, I have omitted it from my
                    representation.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Silliman.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
